## Key Concepts
- Pub/Sub Schema Registry per-tenant
- Dataflow schema-aware processing
- BigQuery per-tenant datasets with time-travel rollback
- Data Catalog/Data Exchange contracts and lineage
- Schema drift detection and automated tests

